nce that another candidate (especially B or C) has strong teamwork/communication skills without the serious interpersonal negatives, or that A\u2019s interpersonal issues have led to crew conflicts, would shift my preference.\nMETADATA_JSON:\n{\"agent\": \"agent_2\", \"vote\": \"Candidate A\"}"}
